/// A latitude and a longitude in decimal degrees on ETRS89, the datum fixed
/// to Europe that GPS positions in Britain are surveyed in. It drifts from
/// WGS84 by about 2.5 cm a year, which is why it is kept apart from `Point`.
decline type.standard_exists: "ETRS89 degrees, fixed to the Eurasian plate, which drift from WGS84 by about 2.5 cm a year"
public type Etrs89Position = Object {
    latitude: Latitude
    longitude: Longitude
}
